  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "智慧科技與金融創新",
    "sub_ename": "SMART TECHNOLOGY AND INNOVATE FINANCE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程提供金融創新應用智慧科技概念、技巧及實作，啟發學生金融科技創新創業或協助傳統金融業者如何充分利用「銀行3.0」環境下的社群網絡及行動載具，期使金融業客戶享有更多元同時一次滿足購物以及金融需求的服務。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to give an insight in the financial technology revolution, and the disruption, innovation and opportunity therein. Students will see the global FinTech investment space, this course will aggregate finance and non-finance industry expertise into a single informative course to provide students with the answers they need to capitalize on this lucrative market. Key industry developments are explained in detail, and critical insights from cutting-edge practitioners offer first-hand information and lessons learned.",
